&lt;li&gt;A strong technical background: you should be able to participate meaningfully in discussions about cloud networking and distributed systems, understand system boundaries and failure modes, and challenge assumptions without needing to be the primary architect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge of networking fundamentals such as IPv4 and IPv6 addressing, routing, network isolation, NAT, firewalls and load balancing. You should be comfortable learning and reasoning about the architecture of a production cloud-networking platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate complex technical topics clearly, facilitate decisions, and produce concise, actionable documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
