&lt;p data-start=&quot;2113&quot; data-end=&quot;2813&quot;&gt;Your role will bridge the gap between senior stakeholders and engineering teams, translating architectural vision into practical delivery. You will lead multi-disciplinary teams working at pace, while also contributing to commercial activity and promoting delivery excellence across our Technology &amp;amp; Engineering Practice through mentoring junior talent, thought leadership, and engagement in the wider cloud community. You&#39;ll embrace approved AI-enabled tools and automation to accelerate architecture design, improve technical analysis, enhance documentation and delivery quality, while applying responsible AI principles, human judgement and appropriate governance throughout solution delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
