&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1239&quot;&gt;As a Data Management Consultant, you&#39;ll join Capco&#39;s Data Strategy &amp;amp; Advisory team, part of our global Data Practice of 1,000+ data professionals. You&#39;ll work with leading Financial Services clients to design, implement and embed modern data management capabilities that support scalable, sustainable and data-driven transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1241&quot; data-end=&quot;1601&quot;&gt;This role blends strategic advisory with hands-on delivery, supporting clients as they adopt AI-enabled, automated and adaptive data management operating models. You&#39;ll help organisations build trusted data foundations that enable AI at scale while ensuring governance, transparency, human oversight and regulatory compliance remain integral to every solution.&lt;/p&gt;
