&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17jube2&quot; data-start=&quot;1871&quot; data-end=&quot;2078&quot;&gt;Enable AI-ready data by establishing standards for metadata, business glossaries, taxonomies, data products and semantic layers that support both trusted business consumption and AI model interoperability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ey49pa&quot; data-start=&quot;2079&quot; data-end=&quot;2272&quot;&gt;Collaborate with architecture, engineering and platform teams to design target-state data architectures that enable scalable AI-driven data management capabilities and modern data ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ycfse4&quot; data-start=&quot;2273&quot; data-end=&quot;2493&quot;&gt;Define governance guardrails, controls and operating models that enable the safe, transparent and effective use of AI within data management, ensuring appropriate human oversight, auditability and regulatory alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3yjcif&quot; data-start=&quot;2494&quot; data-end=&quot;2754&quot;&gt;Deliver and embed core data management capabilities, including data governance, ownership, data quality, metadata, lineage and stewardship, while supporting organisational adoption through stakeholder engagement, change management and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2756&quot; data-end=&quot;2798&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2756&quot; data-end=&quot;2798&quot;&gt;Beyond client delivery, you will also:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
